description: Search Ethereum research data (forum posts, EIPs, manual/ad-hoc reports, papers, and code) via the Meilisearch index. Use when answering questions about Ethereum protocol, looking up EIPs, finding spec details, researching protocol history, searching manual corpus imports, or searching implementation code. Also use when user types /eth-search.
