   121	**2. Exact pseudocode delta against DC §7**
   122	
   123	First apply the adjudicated FG-SA replacement of the SG and available
   124	unit by plain SA. Keep the raw gate, release, whole-result guard, saved
   125	results, S, and leases. Keep DC's exact-entry client and transition.
   126	Set nj=false initially and on every height advance. K=∞ is notation
   127	for this deletion, not a natural-number parameter in the existing Lean
   128	configuration.
   129	
   130	Then replace the root and choice-band calculations by the following
   131	single frame calculation. Do not calculate the contest from a live
   132	cache while calculating its height from a frozen view.
   133	
   134	```text
   135	HEAD_VIEW(s):
   136	    V := ancestor closure of
   137	         admitted blocks received strictly before z_(s−1)
   138	         ∪ admitted current-slot proposal paths
   139	         ∪ paths of declared support
   140	         ∪ paths of live lease targets
   141	         ∪ the current accepted-F evidence basis
   142	    # Paths add no votes or support keys.
   143	    # Keep the original frozen/declared raw and support subsets.
   144	
   145	OTHER_VIEW():
   146	    return full processed admitted tree
   147	
   148	FJ_FRAME(V):
   149	    F := current accepted F
   150	    H := max({1} ∪ {h(W): W∈V})
   151	    (j,J) := lex-greatest (σ[W].h_j, root(σ[W].J)) witnessed in V
   152	             with F ⪯ σ[W].J
   153	    front := {W∈V: h(W)=H}
   154	    contest := (H=j+1 and exists W∈front with not J⪯W)
   155	
   156	    if H=j+1 and not contest:
   157	        Z := J
   158	        lo := H−1
   159	    else if contest:
   160	        Z := F
   161	        lo := H
   162	    else:
   163	        Z := F
   164	        lo := H−1
   165	
   166	    viable := {B∈V: F⪯B and
   167	                    exists W∈V with B⪯W and h(W)≥lo}
   168	    D := {B∈viable: Z⪯B}
   169	    return (F,H,j,J,Z,lo,D,contest)
   170	
   171	get_fg_root(V):
   172	    return FJ_FRAME(V).Z
   173	
   174	get_filtered_block_tree_from(V):
   175	    return FJ_FRAME(V).D
   176	
   177	fgsa_head(V, raw, declared, currentSlot):
   178	    frame := FJ_FRAME(V)
   179	    A := deepest live lease target in frame.D, else frame.Z
   180	    score(B) := raw equivocators
   181	                + clean declared supporters whose HEAD extends B
   182	    eligible(B) := h(B.parent)<frame.lo
   183	                   or 2*score(B)>number_of_raw_participants
   184	                   or B.slot=currentSlot
   185	    return GHOST(A, frame.D, score, eligible)
   186	```
   187	
   188	Full proposal and finality-head reads use OTHER_VIEW. HEADs use
   189	HEAD_VIEW. A lease outside D stays in the raw guard and release test.
   190	The code must change both viability and below-band eligibility in a
   191	contest. Changing only one does not supply the proof that the walk
   192	reaches H.
   193	
