   328	
   329	variable [DecidableEq V] [Fintype V]
   330	
   331	/-- §4 `w(Q_target(σ)) ≥ q` (PROTOCOL.md `alg:state-transition`). Weights
   332	and `q` are the electorate's (PROTOCOL.md `sec:sg-schedule`,
   333	`sec:state-machine`, "weighted quorum threshold"); Goldfish's unit counts
