    28	# Finality slashing evidence
    29	
    30	Purpose: define the protocol-side evidence sets and slashing-weight
    31	predicates used by accountable finality.
    32	An auditor checks the chain/store evidence construction, the per-validator
    33	slashability relation, and the quorum-weight threshold.
    34	
    35	Defines: `chain_attestations`, `store_attestations`, `SlashableBetween`,
    36	`HasIntersectionWeight`, and `HasSlashableWeightBetween`.
    37	Read after: the finality-gadget attestations and protocol store.
    38	Read next: `DecoupledConsensusStatements.Instantiation`.
