    36	debt is.
    37	
    38	This is why crossing a recovery height `H` on branch-agnostic timeout votes buys
    39	the adversary nothing above it: at `H + 1` an honest validator takes
    40	`height_pair`'s adopt branch and emits an exact — hence branch-selective (S2) —
    41	pair. -/
